---
title: "08 - Sequence Diagram Ajukan Peminjaman (Staff)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Staff/Guru
    participant V as Browser/View
    participant P as PeminjamanController
    participant M as Peminjaman (Model)
    participant B as Barang (Model)
    participant DB as Database

    S->>V: Buka menu Ajukan Peminjaman
    V->>P: GET /peminjaman/create
    P->>B: Barang::where&lt;br/&gt;('jumlah_tersedia', '&gt;', 0)-&gt;get()
    B->>DB: SELECT * FROM barangs&lt;br/&gt;WHERE jumlah_tersedia &gt; 0
    DB-->>B: List barang tersedia
    B-->>P: Collection barang
    P-->>V: Tampilkan katalog barang
    S->>V: Pilih barang &amp; isi form&lt;br/&gt;(tgl_pinjam, tgl_rencana,&lt;br/&gt;jumlah, keperluan)
    S->>V: Klik Ajukan
    V->>P: POST /peminjaman (data form)

    P->>P: Validasi FormRequest
    P->>B: Cek stok real-time
    B-->>P: jumlah_tersedia saat ini

    alt Stok tidak cukup
        P-->>V: Redirect back + error&lt;br/&gt;'Stok habis'
        V-->>S: Tampil pesan error
    else Stok cukup
        P->>M: Peminjaman::create(data)
        M->>DB: INSERT INTO peminjamans&lt;br/&gt;status = 'menunggu'
        DB-->>M: OK
        M-->>P: Peminjaman saved
        P-->>V: Redirect + notif sukses
        V-->>S: Tampil 'Pengajuan&lt;br/&gt;berhasil, menunggu&lt;br/&gt;validasi Admin'
    end
